emoji: ✋
name: Pick up when floating
group: core
what: "Float in World" also picks the window up, as grabbing the bar under it does, so you place it in one go; your next click (or letting go of the trigger, if you're still holding it) puts it down.
why: Floating a window and then grabbing its bar to place it takes two clicks; this makes it one.
changes: One dashboard patch (`~/.local/share/frame-tweaks/vr-dashboard/patches/float-grab.js`), via VR dashboard patching (helper)
access: Through VR dashboard patching (helper): SteamVR's dashboard DevTools port while SteamVR runs
survives-updates: Yes; after a SteamVR update it checks SteamVR's dashboard code and switches itself off if that changed
undo: `./install.sh uninstall float-grab` (or untick it in the installer window)
